      "value": "Agreed. This would be a tiny extra detail that could help quite a lot, to offer clues on who someone is. I've also long wished it were possible to see what world you met someone in. Being able to know a time and place, would often be enough to help pin a person to a past memory, and provide an unchanging record that would give some non-intrusive grounding to those with ever shifting names and faces.",
